find any exercises. Use lines like “Leg press 3x12 40 kg”.":"Liftr neatrada nevienu vingrinājumu. Izmanto rindas kā “Leg press 3x12 40 kg”.","Liftr export":"Liftr eksports","Liftr has no account, no server and no advertising. Your workouts, exercises, routines, body measurements and gym pass are stored on your device and in your own private iCloud.":"Liftr nav konta, nav servera un nav reklāmu. Tavi treniņi, vingrinājumi, programmas, ķermeņa mērījumi un sporta zāles karte tiek glabāti tavā ierīcē un tavā privātajā iCloud.","Liftr is built to keep your training private.":"Liftr ir veidota, lai tavi treniņi paliktu privāti.","Liftr saves workouts with duration and calories and reads your weight, body composition and resting heart rate. Change access in the Health app → Profile → Apps → Liftr.":"Liftr saglabā treniņus ar ilgumu un kalorijām un nolasa tavu svaru, ķermeņa sastāvu un miera pulsu. Piekļuvi maini lietotnē Veselība → Profils → Lietotnes → Liftr.","Liftr shows what you did last time, your records and how much stronger you're getting.":"Liftr parāda, ko darīji iepriekšējo reizi, tavus rekordus un cik daudz stiprāks tu kļūsti.","Liftr tries again automatically.":"Liftr automātiski mēģinās vēlreiz.","Liftr tries again later. Your workouts are safe on this device.":"Liftr mēģinās vēlreiz vēlāk. Tavi treniņi ir drošībā šajā ierīcē.","Log weight":"Ievadīt svaru","Log your exercises, sets, reps and weight in seconds — no more notes.":"Pieraksti vingrinājumus, pieejas, atkārtojumus un svaru dažās sekundēs — vairs nekādu piezīmju.","MIN":"MIN","Machine":"Trenažieris","Make a routine":"Izveido programmu","Mark set done":"Atzīmēt pieeju kā izpildītu","Max":"Maks","Min":"Min","Minimise":"Minimizēt","Morning workout":"Rīta treniņš","Most reps":"Visvairāk atk.","Muscle group":"Muskuļu grupa","My gym pass":"Mana sporta zāles karte","My routines":"Manas programmas","Name":"Nosaukums","Name on the pass (optional)":"Vārds uz kartes (neobligāti)","Name, e.g. Monday: legs":"Nosaukums, piem., Pirmdiena: kājas","New":"Jauna","New exercise":"Jauns vingrinājums","New records":"Jauni rekordi","New routine":"Jauna programma","Next":"Tālāk","Next exercise":"Nākamais vingrinājums","No code found":"Kods nav atrasts","No data in this period.":"Šajā periodā nav datu.","No data yet":"Vēl nav datu","No routines yet":"Vēl nav programmu","No tracking":"Nekādas izsekošanas","No weight yet. Log it here or connect a smart scale to Apple Health.":"Vēl nav svara. Ievadi to šeit vai savieno viedos svarus ar lietotni Veselība.","No workout on this day.":"Šajā dienā treniņa nebija.","No workouts this week yet — next week is a fresh start.":"Šonedēļ vēl nav treniņu — nākamā nedēļa ir jauns sākums.","No workouts yet":"Vēl nav treniņu","Not connected":"Nav savienots","Not done yet.":"Vēl nav darīts.","Not now":"Ne tagad","Note":"Piezīme","Note (optional)":"Piezīme (neobligāti)","Notes":"Piezīmes","Notifications":"Paziņojumi","Notifications are off":"Paziņojumi ir izslēgti","Now":"Tagad","Only with your permission, Liftr reads your weight, body composition and resting heart rate, and saves workouts, calories, distance and weight. Health data never leaves your devices through Liftr and is never used for advertising. You can change access at any time in the Health app.":"Tikai ar tavu atļauju Liftr nolasa tavu svaru, ķermeņa sastāvu un pulsu miera stāvoklī, kā arī saglabā treniņus, kalorijas, distanci un svaru. Veselības dati caur Liftr nekad nepamet tavas ierīces un nekad netiek izmantoti reklāmai. Piekļuvi vari jebkurā laikā mainīt lietotnē Veselība.","Open Settings":"Atvērt iestatījumus","Pass":"Karte","Paste":"Ielīmēt","Pause":"Pauze","Point the camera at the code on your pass":"Pavērs kameru pret kodu uz savas kartes","Pounds (lb)":"Mārciņas (lb)","Privacy":"Privātums","Progress":"Progress","Questions?":"Jautājumi?","REPS":"ATK.","REST":"ATPŪTA","Ready to train?":"Gatavs trenēties?","Records":"Rekordi","Reminders":"Atgādinājumi","Reminders and the rest timer are 